NOTE ON THE DATA
The affinity values in data/affinity_raw.csv were transcribed by hand from
tables in open-access articles; each row carries the DOI of its source. The
underlying measurements remain the work of the cited authors, who should be
credited alongside this compilation. The compilation, the computed geometries,
the derived descriptors and all code are released under the licence above.
